      "lines": [
        "в) 这个不等式的两边同乘以 $-4.8$；",
        "г) 这个不等式的两边同除以 $-1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "338",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "338. 已知 $a<b$ 是真不等式。用符号 $<$ 或 $>$ 代替 $\\ast$ 号，使得",
        "结果是真不等式：",
        "а) $-12.7a\\ast-12.7b$；　б) $\\frac{a}{3}\\ast\\frac{b}{3}$；",
        "в) $0.07a\\ast 0.07b$；　г) $-\\frac{a}{2}\\ast-\\frac{b}{2}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "339",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "339. 已知下列不等式成立，比较数 $a$ 与零的大小：",
        "а) $5a<2a$；　б) $7a>3a$；　в) $-3a<3a$；",
        "г) $-12a>-2a$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "340",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "340. 已知 $a>b$。说明根据“小于”和“大于”关系的什么性质",
        "可以断定下列不等式为真不等式：",
        "а) $-7a<-7b$；　б) $\\frac{a}{3}>\\frac{b}{3}$；",
        "в) $2a+11>2b+11$；　г) $0.01a-0.7>0.01b-0.7$；",
        "д) $1-a<1-b$；　е) $2-\\frac{a}{2}<2-\\frac{b}{2}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "341",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "341. 指出“小于”和“大于”关系的有关性质，根据这些性质可",
        "以断定：",
        "а) $(-7x<-28)\\Longrightarrow(x>4)$；",
        "б) $\\left(\\frac{x}{3}<10\\right)\\Longrightarrow(x<30)$；",
        "в) $(5x-1>0)\\Longrightarrow(5x>1)$；",
        "г) $\\left(\\frac{4x-3}{2}>6\\right)\\Longrightarrow(4x-3>12)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "342",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "342. 下列不等式是不是同解不等式？"
      ]
    },
